  "A baseball legend once attacked a fan.",
  "During a 1912 game, star Ty Cobb jumped into the stands.",
  "He punched and kicked a heckler named Claude Lucker.",
  "Lucker had lost eight fingers in an accident and couldn't defend himself.",
  "The American League president suspended Cobb for the assault.",
  "Detroit teammates then refused to play until Cobb was reinstated."
